#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/layer-structure-rfc.md:10
msgid "## 八层"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/layer-structure-rfc.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 层            | 职责                                                        |\n"
"| ------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| kernel        | Hook / EventBus / Logger / Token                            |\n"
"| storage       | schema、repos ports、Config 类型、util、tokenizer、LLM 协议 |\n"
"| mechanism     | tool、llm、compress、hooks、skill、session-port             |\n"
"| orchestration | session、turn、conversation、loop、runtime 门面             |\n"
"| capabilities  | 全部能力包（identity、memory、tools、mcp、acp、estate、…）  |\n"
"| connectors    | I/O + port 实现                                             |\n"
"| service       | 组合根                                                      |\n"
"| entry         | CLI（文档化）                                               |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/layer-structure-rfc.md:23
msgid "## 依赖方向"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/layer-structure-rfc.md:31
msgid "capabilities **包间禁止互依赖**；由 service 组合。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/layer-structure-rfc.md:31
msgid "capabilities **↛ orchestration**。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/layer-structure-rfc.md:31
msgid ""
"orchestration 内部：turn→session，conversation→turn；**禁止** "
"loop→conversation。"
msgstr ""

